{"version":1,"content":"<p>在英偉達創始人黃仁勳的婚外情醜聞導致該公司股價大跌，他本人於周四被迫辭職後，華爾街部分人士對該股變得愈發看空。但散户羣體中依然瀰漫着一股樂觀情緒，他們緊盯着這隻股票，伺機逢低買入，儘管這家公司正處在動蕩之中。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586202.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T06:16:58.093301+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T05:54:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T06:10:17.187777+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T06:10:17.187777+00:00","content_hash":"fb78ff732fd086ba06c17c6373758c4113a0b60761672901c93fd381812a4a3a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}